# Both of these are optional.

# The default analyser calls Ollama on the machine the browser is running on —
# no key, no cost, nothing leaves the laptop. Override these only if your setup
# differs. They are baked in at build time, so rebuild after changing them.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3.6

# There is no Anthropic key setting. The Claude option asks for a key in the
# page itself and keeps it in that browser, so a hosted copy never carries one.
